@startuml
!theme plain
title Sequence Diagram - Registo de Paciente (Auth & Clients Sync)

actor "Paciente (Novo)" as User
participant "API Gateway\n(Ingress)" as Ingress
participant "Auth-Service" as Auth
database "Auth DB\n(Postgres)" as AuthDB
participant "Clients-Service" as Clients
database "Clients DB\n(Postgres)" as ClientsDB

autonumber

' 1. Início do Pedido
User -> Ingress: POST /auth/register\n{email, password, role=PATIENT...}
Ingress -> Auth: Forward Request

activate Auth
    ' 2. Validações Locais
    Auth -> AuthDB: Check if Email Exists

    alt Email Duplicado
        Auth --> User: 400 Bad Request
    else Email Novo
        ' 3. Criação do Login (User)
        Auth -> AuthDB: Save User (Login Data)

        note right of Auth
          Chamada Síncrona (REST)
          para garantir consistência:
          Sem perfil de paciente,
          o login não deve existir.
        end note

        ' 4. Criação do Perfil (Patient) via chamada interna segura
        Auth -> Clients: POST /patients/internal\n(Header: X-INTERNAL-KEY)
        activate Clients
            Clients -> ClientsDB: Check userId
            Clients -> ClientsDB: Save Patient Profile
            Clients --> Auth: 200 OK
        deactivate Clients

        ' 5. Geração do Token
        Auth -> Auth: Generate JWT Token
        Auth --> Ingress: 200 OK {token}
    end
deactivate Auth

' 6. Resposta Final
Ingress --> User: Registo Concluído + Token

@enduml
